                  <msItem>
                     <title>Biblia</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">'A most beautiful large folio bible written on
                        vellum in the 14th century given to the Chartreuse of Sheen by King Henry V,
                        its founder' is noticed by the Abbé Mann (Archaeol. 13 (1800), p. 257), and
                        said to have been in the possession of the community at Newport until
                        1783.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
