                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_496">Sheen, Surrey.
                        Charterhouse of Jesus of Bethlehem</orgName><p>'Biblia domus Ihesu de
                        Bethlehem ordinis Cartusiensis de III ... ex dono illustrissimi regis et
                        principis Henrici quinti fundatoris eiusdem domus cuius anime propicietur
                        deus. Amen', on verso of last flyleaf.</p><p> </p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Arms of James II (?) on the
                     cover.</provenance>
